			 *      `>> 3' is the REGISTER number and the missing factor of
			 *      four is the defect;
			 *    - consequently only 31 of the 112 cells are reachable and
			 *      consecutive registers overlap by three;
			 *    - `re_tex' has NO consumer anywhere in this file -- it is
